      "When ACS becomes NSTEMI, is it a new version of the same condition, or a second condition beside the first?",
      [o("A. A new version of the same condition (same logical id). History keeps the broad term; the board and note show the current one with 'refined from'. A change of identity (ACS → pericarditis) is refute plus a new diagnosis.", "The board never shows both at once; the history view does."),
       o("B. Keep both as separate conditions.", "Clean counting: NSTEMI and ACS would both be counted for one illness, and the note would carry two diagnoses for one event.")],
